{
 "batchId": "b-0253",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_66208393f5ae96a1985d",
   "sourceHash": "66208393f5ae96a1985d93d63d49617988f003608f8f3c53fcad7000c4f95c3f",
   "text": "在喀拉拉邦众多打击乐艺术形式中，琴达鼓（Chenda）这种打击乐器占有独特地位。这件气势恢宏的乐器被视为不可或缺，几乎在喀拉拉邦的每一场活动中都被广泛使用。演奏者用特制的鼓槌在鼓面上敲出繁复的节奏。乐器的圆柱形木质鼓身由腊肠树、糖棕、白柚木和菠萝蜜树的木材制成。其独特之处在于，木材取自菠萝蜜树的树心。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0a7c0bb80555aa71849e",
   "sourceHash": "0a7c0bb80555aa71849e27d24ba413f6af99ac62aa6644c309fa7e8d2969c42d",
   "text": "卡拉里（Kalari）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de0fdc922b9e16175901",
   "sourceHash": "de0fdc922b9e16175901e1413d103af4286836059a1e879133ce89d4f8bbc43b",
   "text": "卡拉里帕亚图（Kalari Payattu）是一种武术，在一种名为 Kalari 的独特练武场中修习。卡拉里的一个重要方面是独特的“Marma”训练，即理解并激发人体 107 个能量点中每一个的技艺。这些 marma（要穴）的作用在于恢复身体的资源并平衡其能量流动。因此，卡拉里使习练者既成为能够自我疗愈的人，也成为一名武者，可运用其疗愈能力帮助他人。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d33dbe314aa8cd729bb6",
   "sourceHash": "d33dbe314aa8cd729bb60aa3699763bcde38fefb8f1733dff3f14fa2b88f405d",
   "text": "卡拉里拥有其独特的阿育吠陀医学专科，用于治疗损伤、身体不适和脱臼。这些方法与按摩配合使用，以缓解肌肉酸痛并提高身体柔韧性。尽管卡拉里在 17 世纪逐渐式微，但如今在喀拉拉邦正迅速重新兴起。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2dce6d380a12612a1329",
   "sourceHash": "2dce6d380a12612a132906d4c25a0fe0f41102527c63e986a4f4e77f9af52fff",
   "text": "整体身心健康静修 | Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_119e173ac3f906b66959",
   "sourceHash": "119e173ac3f906b669597a84bf5068a896e179842194164293d4ad61c05d3b47",
   "text": "在 Kairali 体验纯粹的身心健康：这是一处禁酒、禁烟、无咖啡因的阿育吠陀静修之所，在喀拉拉邦提供瑜伽、冥想与整体疗愈。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1fa322b1cd8cd2f33c31",
   "sourceHash": "1fa322b1cd8cd2f33c31537a5d2e6ab3c3b2dd78c438bad710d3f145999b4dbd",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村提供真正的身心健康与整体照护，让宁静与传统在此交汇。我们的静修之所禁酒、禁烟、无咖啡因，为身心全面和谐提供洁净而焕发活力的环境。沉浸于传统阿育吠陀疗法、瑜伽、冥想与有机生活之中，在喀拉拉邦获得真正具有转变意义的疗愈体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source reads 'Kairali – The Ayurvedic care Village' (apparent typo); rendered with the approved term for 'The Ayurvedic Healing Village' (阿育吠陀疗愈村)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c31323763caedd230280",
   "sourceHash": "c31323763caedd2302802078939a4b1acbcc77257ac88da77302b322a4fdcd86",
   "text": "酒瓶和酒杯被划掉的图标，表示本医院禁酒",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f463355d09230fb827b8",
   "sourceHash": "f463355d09230fb827b8e6107a93e4b41cc51af09114c74eec3041105bd93d44",
   "text": "我们 Kairali 倡导无酒精环境，这有助于对人体产生疗愈作用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c9830df06af38e8e4600",
   "sourceHash": "c9830df06af38e8e4600e3e4681144e6da01b73428337012fdd635fba5ae5314",
   "text": "阅读更多",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a40d4b502926a294e9ae",
   "sourceHash": "a40d4b502926a294e9ae1ac5e3ff00aecab79a026a72c0ca431f4bc0bc5a667b",
   "text": "吸烟有害健康。Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村作为一处健康农庄，始终对吸烟说不。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a06fff5c16794d1636c",
   "sourceHash": "8a06fff5c16794d1636c2354322756ae6830a478bd524a41eaf4749cc96920db",
   "text": "“对咖啡因说不”是本医院和静修之所一贯的做法。咖啡因会加重 dosha（体质能量）失衡并引发疾病。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_454ec1c713c1ca645c3b",
   "sourceHash": "454ec1c713c1ca645c3b3973d911db0ed197b47ea4d7f236a1a6744a55bbb386",
   "text": "Kairali 健康农庄采用全素饮食。我们认为素食易于消化，并含有抗氧化物质，",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2685b61d5be7213075dd",
   "sourceHash": "2685b61d5be7213075ddc7bbc53dde5a4deda484f7855e9cd8ba4326d9dfe8b2",
   "text": "为适应大众的现代生活方式，Kairali Ayurvedic Products 注重持续的研究与开发",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8aeee2c3eface297006f",
   "sourceHash": "8aeee2c3eface297006ffe6d5d88b85f52caadf76255052b4303dcc1698492d5",
   "text": "Kairali 提倡不含防腐剂的食物。我们认为“prana”（生命能量）是食物的活力所在。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e431e829ea0f26c6d989",
   "sourceHash": "e431e829ea0f26c6d989f85f248ab6bc180a5c934ec7e4bc7c69914a89b2adcc",
   "text": "不使用冷藏",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Refridgeration' is a misspelling of 'Refrigeration'; translated by meaning."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8675e9b3f753591af42e",
   "sourceHash": "8675e9b3f753591af42e22dc908a04dd33f7c8613185cd3fca44fcd4f42a55e3",
   "text": "Kairali 奉行“不冷藏”的原则。这是一座成就健康生活的皇家城堡，",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bc743e7fd558d5fc7216",
   "sourceHash": "bc743e7fd558d5fc7216fbd47daa4190fef8031e2695ee2ed1b80afa8a41e301",
   "text": "Kairali 拥有自己的有机菜园，不使用农药、化学品和防腐剂——这些物质会夺走",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0218d17eb6c9e61e2d30",
   "sourceHash": "0218d17eb6c9e61e2d3085f54673e53011a0e80ff7273f973292dbd4f947dd83",
   "text": "阿育吠陀项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_abe15f97dbf36dd89697",
   "sourceHash": "abe15f97dbf36dd896970d95929797285c3a6b73ef59fe92c801ed7c605b4aa4",
   "text": "Kairali 会员资格 | 合作机构 | 资质认证 | 阿育吠陀医院",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
